    nearly all cells form one 8-connected component [observed]
    acts as 4-connected barrier partitioning bg into chambers
    present on grid border (8-12 wall cells touch border) [observed]
  chambers:
    marked: 2-3 chambers each containing exactly 1 marker cell, size 3-13
    unmarked: 5-8 small regions with no marker, size 1-10
    all marked chambers touch the grid border [observed]
  output_rule: >
    flood-fill each marked chamber (4-connected non-wall region containing a marker)
