    2. Build output by partitioning grid into regions with scattered wall cells (color 5)
       occupying ~40% of cells; ensure 4-connected non-wall regions include 2-3 large
       chambers (size 3-13) each fully filled with one marker color, plus several small
       unmarked bg regions
